  WHERE status = 'delivered'
  GROUP BY customer_id
) AS p
INNER JOIN customers AS c ON c.id = p.customer_id
GROUP BY c.country;
```$c8580$, $c8581$La subconsulta produce una fila por cliente con su conteo; la consulta externa promedia esos conteos por país. Los clientes sin pedidos entregados no existen en la tabla derivada.$c8581$, null, null, array[$c8582$subquery$c8582$,$c8583$group_by$c8583$]::text[], 70, true)
